  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0:\n- ADDED: Link tokens (new item, update mode), public token exchange, accounts, transactions sync, refresh, item removal\n- ADDED: Sync.linkItemAsync / syncItemAsync / unlinkItemAsync / refreshItemInfoAsync over IPlaidStore\n- ADDED: webhook verification (Plaid-Verification ES256 JWT) and typed events, UK/EU and US/CA\n- ADDED: JsonFilePlaidStore and InMemoryPlaidStore for development, CSV export\n- ADDED: Api.postAsync / postRawAsync for any endpoint, Api.createLinkTokenForProductsAsync for any products",
